.TH tustat n 0.23.0 tclutils "Tcl Library Procedures"
.SH NAME
tustat \-  tustat  provides stat\-like file metadata helpers around Tcl's file stat.
.SH COMMANDS
.PP
.nf
package require tclutils::tustat
set d [::tclutils::tustat::file README.md]
puts [dict get $d size]
puts [::tclutils::tustat::render $d]
.fi
.PP
Commands:
.IP
\fBfile path\fR returns metadata as a dict.
.IP
\fBfiles paths\fR returns one metadata dict per path.
.IP
\fBrender statDict ?\-timeformat fmt?\fR renders selected fields.

